{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23877","headline":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 一 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫隐深山去，君应到自嫌。\n齿伤朝水冷，貌苦夜霜严。\n渔去风生浦，樵归雪满岩。\n不如来饮酒，相对醉厌厌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}